{"hw":"ἀΐσθω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀΐσθω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀΐσθω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ἄημι</span>) <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> Verb, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">breathe out</b>, <span class=\"gk\">θυμὸν ἄϊσθε</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">he was giving up</b> the ghost, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.403</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16.468</span> </span>.</div></div>"}